# Dredgers Bank - the side quest "The Dredging Camp" played through (plan Relic of the Seventh Tide, side A)
# The camp flat at 1.6 m round -6 0, the safe -10 -9 and its keypad -8.6 -9; the rig 18 0, its deck at 7.
# 10-25 deep pass: after the rig, the tender's lockbox (-36 -46, -9 m) tried without its key, the Spoil Dune (-32 30,
# 14 m; trail foot -32 16) and the foreman's mast (the key), then the tender.
island Dredgers Bank
offset 0 0
expect title The Dredging Camp
walk 6 0 to -4 -2 h=1.6
read Dredge manifest
zone dredge_camp
kill Hyena
expect step 2
open Paymaster's safe
expect message locked
code safekeypad 1234 wrong
code safekeypad 4471
open Paymaster's safe
expect story mapfrag 1
expect item Battery 1
expect step 4
use rigladder
expect height 7.2
zone rig_top
expect step 5
open Tender's lockbox
expect message tender key
zone dunefoot
expect step 6
zone dunetop
expect step 7
read Foreman Lopez's note
expect step 8
open Foreman's survey box
wait 3
expect story tenderkey 1
# (the key-less try already took the player into the zone, so the reach step counts with the key)
zone tender
expect step 10
open Tender's lockbox
wait 2
expect step 11
read Silas Grey's orders
expect done
